    <h2>What's in the Royal Rocky Road Trip Blizzard</h2>
  <p>Classic Rocky Road combines chocolate, nuts, and marshmallow — and DQ's Royal Rocky Road Trip Blizzard delivers all three plus the signature Royal filled center. Brownie pieces provide dense chocolate chew. Almond pieces add a crunchy nut element. Marshmallow topping distributes throughout the soft serve. And the hot fudge-filled center delivers a warm burst of chocolate at the midpoint of every cup. See all Royal Blizzards on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>The Four Royal Blizzards Compared</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
    <thead><tr><th>Royal Blizzard</th><th>Mini Price</th><th>Small Cal</th><th>Filled Center</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><strong>Royal Rocky Road Trip</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>530</td><td>Hot fudge</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/royal-oreo-blizzard">Royal Oreo®</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>490</td><td>Hot fudge</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/royal-reeses-blizzard">Royal Reese's®</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>620</td><td>Peanut butter</td></tr>
      <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/royal-new-york-cheesecake-blizzard">Royal NY Cheesecake</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>510</td><td>Strawberry</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <h2>Who Should Order This Blizzard</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Rocky road ice cream fans who want the same flavor profile in Blizzard form</li>
    <li>Guests who enjoy the <a href="/items/choco-brownie-blizzard">Choco Brownie Extreme Blizzard</a> but want nut and marshmallow complexity added</li>
    <li>Anyone wanting the deepest, most multi-layered chocolate Blizzard on the menu</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Allergen Note</h2>
  <p>The Royal Rocky Road Trip Blizzard contains tree nuts (almonds). Not suitable for guests with nut allergies. Consider the <a href="/items/royal-oreo-blizzard">Royal Oreo Blizzard</a> for a nut-free Royal option.</p>
