<h2>Royal Rocky Road Trip — The Most Complex Royal Blizzard</h2>
<p>The Royal Rocky Road Trip Blizzard has the most components of any Royal Blizzard — brownie pieces, almond pieces, marshmallow topping, and a hot fudge-filled center. This complexity makes it the most texturally interesting Royal Blizzard, with something different in every spoonful. Find all Royal Blizzards and their prices on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
<h2>Nutrition Note</h2>
<p>At 530 cal (Small), the Royal Rocky Road Trip is mid-range in the Royal Blizzard calorie hierarchy. The <a href="/items/royal-reeses-blizzard">Royal Reese's</a> is higher at 620 cal. The <a href="/items/royal-oreo-blizzard">Royal Oreo</a> is lower at 490 cal. The Rocky Road is the right middle ground for guests who want complexity without maximum calorie density.</p>
